                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "853e6367-5b8d-3557-b507-9012ea158ad3",
                                        "entry_id": "c7944ef2-830a-3002-bd5a-902d7223ffd8",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "A Classical comic actor, especially one who works mainly through gesture and mime."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [
                                            "archaic",
                                            "countable",
                                            "uncountable"
                                        ],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "c22ebcee-760a-4a90-8b1f-53e4036679b2",
                                                "sense_id": "853e6367-5b8d-3557-b507-9012ea158ad3",
                                                "text": "[He] saw a pantomime perform so well that he could follow the performance from the action alone."
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    },
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "e226bad3-4c5e-3936-86e4-0f0b3cbbe3f5",
                                        "entry_id": "c7944ef2-830a-3002-bd5a-902d7223ffd8",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "The drama in ancient Greece and Rome featuring such performers; or (later) any of various kinds of performance modelled on such work."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [
                                            "countable",
                                            "historical",
                                            "uncountable"
                                        ],
                                        "examples": []
                                    },
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "6a8f42a2-ec0b-3b07-acbb-3812e156bd58",
                                        "entry_id": "c7944ef2-830a-3002-bd5a-902d7223ffd8",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "A traditional theatrical entertainment, originally based on the commedia dell'arte, but later aimed mostly at children and involving physical comedy, topical jokes, call and response, and fairy-tale plots."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [
                                            "UK",
                                            "countable",
                                            "uncountable"
                                        ],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "7dc00f21-ad0c-405e-8603-6685628240c3",
                                                "sense_id": "6a8f42a2-ec0b-3b07-acbb-3812e156bd58",
                                                "text": "With the Stoke supporters jeering Ziv's every subsequent touch, the pantomime atmosphere created by the home crowd reached a crescendo when Ziv was shown a straight red shortly after the break in extraordinary circumstances."
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    },
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "aa25ea46-e227-3369-87fc-0d7114605609",
                                        "entry_id": "c7944ef2-830a-3002-bd5a-902d7223ffd8",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "The act of gesturing without speaking; a dumb-show, a mime."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [
                                            "countable",
                                            "uncountable"
                                        ],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "a50d2b71-7a13-4cd4-95c3-e754a7ea132a",
                                                "sense_id": "aa25ea46-e227-3369-87fc-0d7114605609",
                                                "text": "#*: A staid, steadfast man, whose life for the most part was a telling pantomime of action, and not a tame chapter of sounds."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "721d43b6-882d-45be-bdd0-3483ff5ae338",
                                                "sense_id": "aa25ea46-e227-3369-87fc-0d7114605609",
                                                "text": "In pantomime, Chief Joyi would fling his spear and creep along the veld as he narrated the victories and defeats."
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    }
                                ]
                            },
                            {
